EXTREMELY STRONG HAND A CRUSHING

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:07.872
JEROME CORSI.

00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:18.683
JEROME CORSI, AND MR. CORSI,

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:20.485
THANKS VERY MUCH FOR COMING ON.

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:21.653
LAST WE SPOKE MY UNDERSTANDING

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.454
WAS FOR OUR PREVIOUS

00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:25.924
CONVERSATION, YOU MADE A

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.091
MISTAKE.

00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:28.693
HE SAID, HE FORGOT THE DATE OF

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:30.094
AN EMAIL THAT YOU FORWARDED AND

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:32.063
YOU WENT AND TOLD THE SPECIAL

00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:33.164
PROSECUTOR'S OFFICE THAT THEY

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:35.500
