00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:39.671
YOU DIDN'T SAY WHAT THEY WANTED

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:45.310
YOU TO SAY, THEY CAME BACK TO

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:47.478
PROSECUTE YOU FOR LYING.

00:00:47.479 --> 00:00:51.783
IS THAT CORRECT?

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:52.817
&gt;&gt; THEY HADN'T RELOADED THE

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:55.019
FIRST DAY OF TESTIMONY AND I HAD

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:55.687
FORGOTTEN ABOUT TWO EMAILS.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:59.524
WHEN I FINALLY LOADED THE TIME

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:00.358
MACHINE, I REALIZED THESE EMAILS

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:01.159
WHERE THEY ARE.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.897
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  A

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:05.930
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  L

00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:05.964
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  W

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:05.997
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  D

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:06.030
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  M

00:01:06.031 --> 00:01:06.064
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  E

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:06.097
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  T

00:01:06.098 --> 00:01:06.864
SPECIAL PROSECUTOR HE ALLOWED  O

00:01:06.865 --> 00:01:08.099
AMEND THE TESTIMONY, AND IN THE

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.667
ONE COUNT I WANTED TO PLEAD

00:01:09.668 --> 00:01:11.836
GUILTY TO, THEY WANTED TO CHARGE

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:13.037
ME WITH KNOWINGLY AND WILLFULLY

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:16.240
GIVING FALSE INFORMATION ON THE

00:01:16.241 --> 00:01:16.874
ORIGINAL DAYS MISTAKE, NOT

00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:17.575
TAKING INTO ACCOUNT THAT THEY

00:01:17.576 --> 00:01:19.744
HAD ALLOWED ME COME THE SPECIAL

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:24.082
PROSECUTOR, TO AMEND THE

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.283
TESTIMONY WHICH I THOUGHT WAS

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:26.651
COMPLETELY FRAUDULENT.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:27.318
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IS CERTAINLY ODD

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:28.486
AND MOST LAWYERS THAT WE HAD

00:01:28.487 --> 00:01:29.520
SPOKEN TO HADN'T HEARD OF

00:01:29.521 --> 00:01:32.056
SOMETHING LIKE THAT.

00:01:32.057 --> 00:01:34.459
WHY WERE THEY PRESSING YOU ON

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:34.759
THAT?

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.494
&gt;&gt; FROM DAY ONE, THEY BLEW UP.

00:01:36.495 --> 00:01:37.862
THEY SAID THEY WOULD HAVE ENOUGH

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:39.998
TO THROW ME IN PRISON BECAUSE I

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.666
HAVE GOTTEN THESE EMAILS.

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:43.501
I'M CONVINCED IT WAS ALL

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:43.935
STRATEGY.

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:45.503
I WENT IN TO COOPERATE.

00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:48.473
I GAVE MY COMPUTERS, I GAVE MY

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:49.307
TIME MACHINE, I HANDED OVER

00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:51.743
VOLUNTARILY MY EMAILS AND MY

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:55.013
TWITTER ACCOUNT, ET CETERA.

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.180
EVERYTHING THEY WANTED.

00:01:56.181 --> 00:01:57.382
THE FIRST DAY IS A MEMORY TEST,

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.050
I DON'T GET THE MEMORY TEST

00:01:59.051 --> 00:01:59.784
RIGHT AND SUDDENLY I WILL BE

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:01.819
THROWN IN PRISON FOR THE REST OF

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:02.487
MY LIFE.

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:03.821
IT'S AN INTIMIDATION TACTIC AND

00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:06.290
I'M QUITE CONVINCED IT'S

00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:07.025
INTENTIONAL.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.326
&gt;&gt; Tucker: INTIMIDATING YOU TO

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:09.060
GET YOU TO DO WHAT?

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:11.763
WHAT DO THEY WANT YOU TO DO THAT

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:13.164
YOU REFUSE TO DO?

00:02:13.165 --> 00:02:15.299
&gt;&gt; THE KEY THING IS THEY WANTED

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:21.239
ME TO BE THE KEY LINK BETWEEN

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.041
ROGER'S OWN, TO ME, TO JULIE AND

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.442
MASSAGE.

00:02:24.443 --> 00:02:26.644
THEN ROGER STONE TO STEVE BANNON

00:02:26.645 --> 00:02:28.946
AND DONALD TRUMP, IN

00:02:28.947 --> 00:02:34.318
COORDINATION WITH MASADA.

00:02:34.319 --> 00:02:34.585
M.

00:02:34.586 --> 00:02:40.958
ON THAT FLIGHT I CALCULATED AND

00:02:40.959 --> 00:02:43.428
FIGURED OUT -- I HAVE NEVER MET

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:45.163
HIM OR EMAILED HIM, AND I HAVE

00:02:45.164 --> 00:02:45.930
NO CONTACT WITH ANYONE WHO IS IN

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:49.167
TOUCH WITH HIM.

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:50.101
AND THE PROSECUTORS REFUSED TO

00:02:50.102 --> 00:02:51.369
BELIEVE THIS.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:52.036
SO IT LED TO GRILLING AFTER

00:02:52.037 --> 00:02:56.474
GRILLING AFTER GRILLING.

00:02:56.475 --> 00:02:57.842
CONSTANTLY -- THEY HAVE AN

00:02:57.843 --> 00:03:00.478
8-INCH THICK BOOK WITH MY NAME

00:03:00.479 --> 00:03:02.847
ON IT AND MR. ZELINSKI, ONE OF

00:03:02.848 --> 00:03:03.548
THE PROSECUTORS, WON'T TELL ME

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:08.252
IF IT'S ALL ABOUT ME.

00:03:08.253 --> 00:03:09.821
THEY ARE ASKING ME QUESTIONS AND

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:11.956
PULLING FILES OUT AND SAYING

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:13.257
THIS EMAIL CONTRADICTS IT.

00:03:13.258 --> 00:03:14.292
WELL I DON'T REMEMBER THAT

00:03:14.293 --> 00:03:17.295
EMAIL, I DON'T REMEMBER IN

00:03:17.296 --> 00:03:31.543
DETAIL ANY OF MY EMAILS.

